    "category": "😃 Smileys & People",
    "description": "A person shrugging their shoulders to indicate a lack of knowledge about a particular topic, or a lack of care about the result of a situation., Displays as raised shoulders, sometimes in conjunction with raised arms and flat hands. The shrug gesture in text (emoticon) form is known as a shruggie and typed as: ¯\\_(ツ)_/¯, The Unicode character Shrug (\"Person Shrugging\") does not specify a gender though is displayed as a woman on most major platforms. See also Woman Shrugging or Man Shrugging., , Person Shrugging was approved as part of Unicode 9.0 in 2016, under the name “Shrug”, and added to Emoji 3.0 in 2016.",
