    "category": "😃 Smileys & People",
    "description": "A woman singer or rock star generally displayed with a microphone, and sometimes musical notes., iOS and Android display this emoji as a Bowie-esque figure while WhatsApp appears heavily inspired by Prince., The Woman Singer emoji is a sequence of the 👩 Woman and 🎤 Microphone emojis., These are combined using a zero width joiner between each character and display as a single emoji on supported platforms., , Woman Singer was added to Emoji 4.0 in 2016.",
