    "emoji": "🦏",
    "category": "🐻 Animals & Nature",
    "description": "A rhinoceros, a large mammal with one or two massive horns on its nose. Generally shown in light gray with two horns, depicted in full profile on all fours or as a rhinoceros head looking left., Resembles the white or black rhinoceros., Apple, Microsoft, WhatsApp, and Facebook’s designs feature the full animal; Google, Samsung, and Twitter’s designs feature only a rhinoceros head. Facebook’s design previously featured only a rhinoceros head., , Rhinoceros was approved as part of Unicode 9.0 in 2016, and added to Emoji 3.0 in 2016.",
