    "description": "A spider, an eight-legged arachnid that spins a web. Depicted as a common black spider, as a house spider or funnel-web spider, shown from above with its large abdomen oriented at the bottom., See also 🕸️ Spider Web. Commonly used during Halloween and to represent the superhero Spider-Man., Google's spider is upside down, suspended from a thread. Facebook’s spider is shown on its eight legs facing left. Microsoft’s spider was previously a black widow, Samsung’s was brown., , Spider was approved as part of Unicode 7.0 in 2014, and added to Emoji 1.0 in 2015.",
