    "emoji": "🌟",
    "category": "🐻 Animals & Nature",
    "description": "A glowing, five-point gold star. Depicted as ⭐ Star with stylized bursts in between its points, representing glowing or twinkling., Commonly used to represent various senses of glowing as well for as for a sense of flourish. Not to be confused with 💫 Dizzy, ⭐ Star, 🌠 Shooting Star, or ✨ Sparkles, though their applications may overlap., On Snapchat, this emoji displays next to a contact who has had their snaps replayed in the past 24 hours., Microsoft’s bursts are blue lines, though were previously yellow. Apple’s star previously resembled its ⭐ Star. Samsung’s star previously displayed a burst radiating out from its center., , Glowing Star was approved as part of Unicode 6.0 in 2010, and added to Emoji 1.0 in 2015.",
