    "description": "A door, as to the entrance of a room, house, or new opportunity. (We’ll see ourselves out 🚪🚶.) Depicted in brown, as made of wood, with a gold handle., May represent literal doors and related concepts (e.g., rooms, houses) but often used figuratively (e.g., opening or closing metaphorical doors)., Google’s design features a peephole and Microsoft’s a step, as if a front door., , Door was approved as part of Unicode 6.0 in 2010, and added to Emoji 1.0 in 2015.",
